    "Virtual machines in 'Host' network mode can be placed in the same network to communicate with each other." : {

    },
    "Virtual machines using this mode in the same UTM app can connect to each other and access the internet through your Mac." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-HK" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
